WEBVTT

00:10:38.445 --> 00:10:42.186
♪ And I'd stay forever ♪ 
(Dan aku ingin tinggal selamanya)

00:10:42.186 --> 00:10:45.471
♪ but my home ♪
(tapi rumahku)

00:10:45.471 --> 00:10:49.150
♪ is slightly too far ♪ 
(terlalu jauh)

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:51.973
♪ from this place ♪ 
(dari sini)

00:10:51.973 --> 00:10:56.327
♪ And I swear I tried to ♪ 
(Dan sungguh, aku mencoba untuk)

00:10:56.327 --> 00:10:59.938
♪ slow it down ♪ 
(berjalan lebih pelan)

00:10:59.938 --> 00:11:06.883
♪ when I am walking at your pace ♪ 
(mengikuti langkahmu)